<main class="service-detail-page"><div class="container"><div class="row service-detail-layout"><aside class="col-lg-4"><div class="service-sidebar"><div class="service-nav-card"><h3>Freight Services</h3><ul><li><a href="ocean-freight.html">Ocean Freight <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a></li><li><a href="air-freight.html">Air Freight <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a></li><li><a href="cargo-freight.html">Cargo Freight <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a></li><li><a href="express-delivery.html">Express Delivery <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a></li><li><a href="customs-clearance.html">Customs Clearance <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a></li><li><a class="active" href="project-cargo.html">Project Cargo <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a></li><li><a href="pet-transport.html">Pet Transport <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a></li></ul></div><div class="service-help-card"><h3>Moving specialist cargo?</h3><p>Share cargo drawings, measurements, weights, the route, site conditions, and required dates.</p><a href="contact.html">Start a project review <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right ms-2"></i></a></div></div></aside>
<div class="col-lg-8"><div class="service-main-image"><img src="/images/service-6.jpg" alt="Oversized project cargo prepared for specialized transportation"></div>
<section class="service-overview"><div class="service-kicker">Careful planning for demanding moves</div><h1>Specialist coordination for complex cargo</h1><p>Heavy, oversized, valuable, or complex shipments need detailed preparation. <%= business.name %> plans project cargo around equipment, route conditions, handling stages, paperwork, schedules, and destination-site requirements.</p><p>We agree responsibilities and milestones with customers and specialist partners before transport begins, helping teams prepare for constraints and manage important handoffs.</p></section>
<section class="service-features"><h2 class="service-section-title">Project cargo capabilities</h2><div class="row g-4"><div class="col-md-6"><div class="service-feature"><i class="fa-solid fa-ruler-combined"></i><h3>Load assessment</h3><p>We review dimensions, weights, lifting points, center of gravity, and handling needs.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-6"><div class="service-feature"><i class="fa-solid fa-map-location-dot"></i><h3>Route planning</h3><p>We consider site access, route limitations, transfer points, and destination conditions.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-6"><div class="service-feature"><i class="fa-solid fa-gears"></i><h3>Specialized coordination</h3><p>We plan the transport, lifting, loading, securing, and transfer resources the cargo requires.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-6"><div class="service-feature"><i class="fa-solid fa-diagram-project"></i><h3>Milestone management</h3><p>We keep teams informed about responsibilities, dependencies, and key stages of the move.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="service-process"><h2 class="service-section-title">From planning to project delivery</h2><div class="row g-4"><div class="col-md-6 col-xl-3"><div class="service-process-step"><div class="service-process-number">01</div><h3>Scope</h3><p>We review the cargo, sites, route, and project goals.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-6 col-xl-3"><div class="service-process-step"><div class="service-process-number">02</div><h3>Engineer</h3><p>We plan equipment, handling methods, and transport stages.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-6 col-xl-3"><div class="service-process-step"><div class="service-process-number">03</div><h3>Prepare</h3><p>We coordinate paperwork, resources, and participating teams.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-6 col-xl-3"><div class="service-process-step"><div class="service-process-number">04</div><h3>Execute</h3><p>We follow the agreed transport controls and project milestones.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="service-faqs"><h2 class="service-section-title">Questions about project cargo</h2><div class="accordion" id="projectFaq"><div class="accordion-item"><h3><button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#projectOne">What do you need to assess a project shipment?</button></h3><div id="projectOne" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" data-bs-parent="#projectFaq"><div class="accordion-body">Send cargo drawings or specifications, dimensions, weight, lifting details, origin and destination site information, readiness dates, and the target delivery schedule.</div></div></div><div class="accordion-item"><h3><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#projectTwo">Does an oversized shipment need special preparation?</button></h3><div id="projectTwo" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#projectFaq"><div class="accordion-body">Usually. It may require route checks, permits, escorts, specialist equipment, lifting plans, and arrangements with local authorities or site teams.</div></div></div><div class="accordion-item"><h3><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#projectThree">Can a project use more than one transport method?</button></h3><div id="projectThree" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#projectFaq"><div class="accordion-body">Yes. Project shipments can combine road, port, sea, air, or specialist transfers within a single coordinated plan.</div></div></div></div></section>
<div class="service-cta"><div><h2>Bring us your complex move</h2><p>Tell us about the cargo and we’ll help develop a practical transport plan.</p></div><a href="/quote?service=project_cargo" class="btn-default">Start a Project Review</a></div></div></div></div></main><%- include('../partials/site-footer') %><script src="/js/jquery-3.7.1.min.js"></script><script src="/js/bootstrap.min.js"></script><script src="/js/jquery.slicknav.js"></script><script src="/js/service-navigation.js"></script></body></html>
